SetLiquidationConfigurationTest
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when max liquidation LTV is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when max liquidation LTV is greater than WAD
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when dynamic bonus fee start is greater than WAD
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when ltv for complete liquidation is less than max liquidation LTV
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when ltv for complete liquidation is greater than WAD
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when liquidation base fee is greater than WAD
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when min penalty percentage is greater than WAD
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when all parameters are valid
        └── it should update liquidation configuration 